rule: TEST_PATCHES_SUBJECT
title: a test patches through a target no one hop can read, so the patch is opaque
origin: #196 188.5 C - the target comes from a helper call; an opaque target may replace anything the assertions check
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app import billing


def test_invoice_total(mocker):
    items = [10.0, 90.0]
    assert billing.invoice_total(items, 0.053) == 105.3
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app import billing


def target_for(name):
    return "app.billing." + name


def test_invoice_total(mocker):
    mocker.patch(target_for("invoice_total"), return_value=105.3)
    items = [10.0, 90.0]
    assert billing.invoice_total(items, 0.053) == 105.3
=== head: src/app/billing.py ===
def invoice_total(items, tax):
    return round(sum(items) * (1 + tax), 2)
